    "разом": 27809,
    "опис_en": "I built this for your office day around the boots you asked for. The day is rainy and involves a fair amount of walking, with formality around 5 to 6. The fitted blazer carries the work level (rated 5 to 7). The grey knit top sits at the low end of the range (3 to 5), the straight trousers (3 to 7) and the boots (4 to 6) overlap it, so nothing feels dressier or sloppier than the rest. The palette is neutrals with one accent: grey, black and a taupe boot, with the mustard bag as the single accent. Two trade-offs: you asked for suede, and these boots are nubuck, which is close in look but not the same material. I have no evidence that the boots, or any other piece here, are water-resistant, so I won't promise rain protection. I also don't know the temperature, the surface you'll walk on or the boot soles, so I'm making no claims about warmth or grip. The boots have a 6 cm heel, which is something to keep in mind for a lot of walking. I'm not judging fit or proportions, because that assessment was withheld.",
    "як_носити_en": [
     "Wear the grey knit as the base layer. Its hem sits at the waist, so you can leave it loose over the high-rise trousers.",
     "Put the belt through the trouser loops at the waist, so the waist is the one marked point of the outfit.",
     "Wear the blazer open over the top, so the belt shows and the hip-length line stays clean.",
     "Wear the trousers at their calf length, loose over the boots, and finish with the black earrings."
    ],
